   for n in (names if (pair+i)%2==0 else names[::-1]):samples[n].append(invoke(n,'capacity',[r/'grammars'/(x['grammar']+'.so'),x['symbol'],7,r/x['source']],env))
   for k in ['hash','nodes','groups','capacity','retained_bytes']:assert samples['fields'][-1][k]==samples['scratch'][-1][k]
  data['large'].append(dict(points=1,index=i,grammar=x['grammar'],context=context,samples=samples));save()
  med={n:statistics.median(v['median_ms'] for v in samples[n]) for n in names};print('large',i,x['grammar'],context,med,flush=True)
